   "source": "# Suite PKG — The packages\n\nThe Python (`mbse.{{PACKAGE}}`) and TypeScript (`{{NPM}}`) packages are one library in two languages, and share one version: mbse-basis [PRI-031: the version is the contract](https://github.com/pitaman71/mbse-basis/blob/main/docs/PRINCIPLES.md#PRI-031).",
   "id": "c0"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "import json\nimport tomllib\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport mbse.{{PACKAGE}} as package\n\nROOT = Path.cwd().parent.parent",
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "id": "c1"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"PKG-01\"></a>\n## PKG-01 · Both packages carry one version, and the package loads",
   "id": "c2"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "python = tomllib.loads((ROOT / \"python3\" / \"pyproject.toml\").read_text())[\"project\"][\"version\"]\ntypescript = json.loads((ROOT / \"typescript5\" / \"package.json\").read_text())[\"version\"]\nassert python == typescript, (python, typescript)\nassert package.__name__ == \"mbse.{{PACKAGE}}\", package.__name__",
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "id": "c3"
  }
